==Notes==   
* This armor is labeled [[Granite Citadel armor#Granite Citadel Ascended Armor|Granite Citadel Ascended Armor]] in the [["Resilience"]] monument in the [[Hall of Monuments]].
*The female variation of the armor can clip or bleed-through on the back portion of the coat's neck with some character hair styles.
*Part of the sleeve on the male attire appears green when dyed certain colors.

